        <p class="hero__description">
          SDF Clothing is a yoga pants manufacturer in Bangladesh producing custom yoga pants with 4-way stretch fabrics, moisture-wicking technology, and compression fits. High-waist, flare, capri, and full-length styles available from 300 pieces minimum. 15-20 day sampling, 30-40 day production.
        </p>
